  "totalBlocks": 48,
  "translatedBlocks": 23,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b31d17be09dbdb8c",
      "translationZh": "测试了 15 个本地模型用于智能体/工具调用——Bonsai 27B 排名垫底",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8f2a5cff5b642f2",
      "translationZh": "我想看看哪些本地模型实际上适用于智能体/工具使用任务，因此我将15个模型通过了同一基准测试，而不是根据模型炒作进行猜测。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5fe08c921239a56",
      "translationZh": "该基准测试是 Toolery。它不仅仅检查模型是否能够调用工具，其场景还要求模型在不同的约束条件下实际完成任务。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "63238d0db6756ad8",
      "translationZh": "简单、中等、困难和极难等级",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee9c94b90ece035d",
      "translationZh": "所有通过 LM Studio 在本地提供的服务",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "011092e18516b66d",
      "translationZh": "每个模型均支持 30k token 上下文窗口",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5994d27070d05ba8",
      "translationZh": "所有模型的 Temperature 均为 0.8",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f72883ab61c1312",
      "translationZh": "否则，我保留了 LM Studio 中每个模型自带的默认设置",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a2e5ebb52ee85261",
      "translationZh": "例外是 qwen3.8-flash-next，当时我使用的是 Strata，但我仍将温度设置为 0.8",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "af9b76c55c363a4a",
      "translationZh": "模型得分 简单 中等 困难 极难",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee2ab062cf2791d7",
      "translationZh": "所以，是的，Bonsai 的总排名是最后一名。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f732bceb683abf9c",
      "translationZh": "在“非常困难”的场景中，它的排名也垫底，得分仅为 22.2%。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc57f2cee91a0742",
      "translationZh": "但更有趣的部分是它为何失败。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d77676b78ad422d",
      "translationZh": "Bonsai 有 148 次失败的试验。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e19331dc438c081",
      "translationZh": "其中 103 个触发了预算违规。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5809d0e4d1b14249",
      "translationZh": "这意味着模型通常选择了正确的工具并获得了正确的结果，但随后进行了超出场景允许次数的一次额外工具调用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88637dd98b12f517",
      "translationZh": "只有30个故障被归类为工具选择错误导致的故障。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d404bab26a29f072",
      "translationZh": "所以问题并不总是：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "545c276f6b51ade6",
      "translationZh": "我不知道该使用哪个工具。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec9cd7d4fc47ac16",
      "translationZh": "我知道自己在做什么，让我再调用一次。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f79e68f4dda44720",
      "translationZh": "然后它违反了工具预算。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b361aa4a71f299f",
      "translationZh": "那其实是我觉得最有意思的部分。模型有时能正确执行任务，但它不知道何时该停止。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55afca1376a74393",
      "translationZh": "qwen3.8-27b 以 71.8% 的成绩排名第一",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    }
  ],
